SELECT NULL, 'ai', 'complexity', 'medium', 'en', 'javascript', 'Cost of process(n)', 'What is the asymptotic time complexity of the function `process(n)` defined below?', 'class Bucket{
  constructor(s){
    this.items=[];
    for(let i=0;i<s;++i) this.items.push(i);
  }
  drain(){
    while(this.items.length) this.items.shift();
  }
}
function process(n){
  const arr=[];
  for(let i=1;i<=n;++i) arr.push(new Bucket(i));
  for(const b of arr) b.drain();
}', '["O(n^3)","O(n log n)","O(n)","O(n^2)"]', 'A', NULL, 'Think about how costly `Array.shift()` is when called repeatedly inside `drain()`, and then sum that cost for all bucket sizes created in `process`.', 'Draining a bucket of size i performs i shifts; each shift costs O(k) where k is the current length, so the total for one bucket is Θ(i²). Summing i² for i=1..n yields Θ(n³), which dominates the Θ(n²) cost of building the buckets.', 'time complexity', NULL, NULL, 'active', 1791503680, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL
